# ============================================================
#  NEVER COMMIT CLIENT DATA TO THIS REPOSITORY.
#
#  This repo is PUBLIC (GitHub Pages on the free plan requires it).
#  A questionnaire file contains Social Security numbers, dates of
#  birth, account numbers and a complete financial picture. Once a
#  file is committed and pushed it is in the git history forever —
#  deleting it in a later commit does NOT remove it. Recovering from
#  that means rewriting history and force-pushing, and assuming the
#  data was already scraped.
#
#  Client answers belong in your matter files, not here.
# ============================================================

# saved questionnaire files, in any form
*.json
*.slq
Questionnaire-*
questionnaire-*

